{"id":368,"search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Act One Act Two","slug":"act-one-act-two-emaar-properties-downtown-dubai","display_address":"Downtown Dubai","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":10561888,"display_price":"10.56M","lattitude":25.1915489,"longitude":55.273758,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Act One Act Two is a luxury project by Emaar, located in the heart of Dubai's Downtown Dubai district. The development comprises two towers of 52 and 46 storeys and offers premium <strong>1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartments</strong> designed in the style of the iconic The Dubai Fountain. All residences feature the highest quality finishes and the dynamic facades of these architectural masterpieces look out over the world's most famous skyscraper, Burj Khalifa.<br>Act One Act Two boasts a fully equipped gymnasium and health club to support an active lifestyle. The climate-controlled pools offer a respite from the heat and a variety of workouts. It is the perfect place to relax and admire the stunning views of the legendary skyline.<br>The complex is in a prime location in the Downtown Dubai area near the famous Dubai Opera, beckoning you to immerse yourself in a world of cultural events. Sheikh Mohammed Bin Rashid Boulevard is home to an array of exotic restaurants and cafes from a variety of cuisines around the world, while The Dubai Mall and Souk Al Bahar offer a more memorable experience. The project is also located close to the Dubai Metro, making it easy for residents to get anywhere in the city. The Palm Jumeirah and Dubai Marina are approximately 25 minutes away, while the world's largest airport, Al Maktoum International Airport, is about 35 minutes away.<br>Act One Act Two is the ideal choice for those seeking a premium lifestyle in the heart of a bustling metropolis.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":n